     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi folks,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;ll be talking today at 1pm. We&#39;ll be live-streaming the talk on YouTube here:<b> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/_Fgx229pWi8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://youtu.be/_Fgx229pWi8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467151066000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Aq3jxOrdozV9ftdtpZNj6\">https://youtu.be/_Fgx229pWi8</a></b></div><div><br></div><div>Please join us!  <br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div><div>One other thing to mention, I&#39;ll be using the development version of RStudio, though much of the talk will work in the current version as well. If you are interested, please <a href=\"https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/preview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/preview/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467151066000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UXchwq6lqmUbLfYFMSGLR\">download a copy</a> so you can follow along.</div><div><br></div><div>Finally, all the code and materials will be here on Github:  <b><a href=\"https://github.com/ryanpeek/rmarkdown_notebook_demo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ryanpeek/rmarkdown_notebook_demo&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467151066000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0iBQUyTWvGbYYUnHG35B_-\">https://github.com/ryanpeek/rmarkdown_notebook_demo</a></b></div><div><br></div><div>See you at 1pm!</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>Ryan</div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;line-height:19px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div>PhD Candidate, Graduate Group in Ecology<br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Center for Watershed Sciences<br></div></font></span><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-weight:norm